WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.002
Welcome to Module 14. This module introduces a compact machine-learning workflow using external-style data.

00:00:08.002 --> 00:00:14.642
We will separate features and target, create training and test data, fit a simple classifier,

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:21.518
evaluate predictions, compare against a baseline, and discuss leakage and responsible interpretation.
